# Secrets for Kamal deployment.
#
# The only secret needed is the GHCR registry password, passed in via the
# KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD environment variable:
#   - In CI, the deploy workflow sets it to the job's GITHUB_TOKEN.
#   - Locally, export it before deploying, e.g.
#       export KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$(gh auth token)   # needs write:packages
#
# SECRET_KEY_BASE is a clear env var in deploy.yml — this is a public read-only
# docs site, so the key is not sensitive enough to warrant a secrets fetch.
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD
